OL,3,GNEWSA'Conservation win' as chicks hatch
OL,4,Aon reserve raft
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first chicks hatching at a nature
OL,7,Freserve's new raft have been hailed a
OL,8,F"win for conservation".
OL,10,FCommon tern chicks have been spotted on
OL,11,Fthe raft at Rainton Meadows Nature
OL,12,FReserve in Houghton-le-Spring for the
OL,13,Ffirst time.
OL,15,FDurham Wildlife Trust, which manages
OL,16,Fthe site, said natural nesting sites
OL,17,Fhad become harder to find, meaning
OL,18,Fpurposeb@Qbuilt rafts were
OL,19,F"increasingly important for supporting
OL,20,Fthe species".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
